                      "content": "Preview above renders in Dela Gothic One (the real fallback the browser picks for VN glyphs) — Special Gothic Expanded One has no VN glyph coverage.\n\nLive font-family stack:\n  \"Special Gothic Expanded One\", \"Dela Gothic One\", system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Arial, sans-serif\n  font-weight: 400\n\nSanity-check: every diacritic (ả, ấ, ệ, ế, ự) should appear on the character it belongs to, not as a missing-glyph square or dropped mark.",
