                      "name": "Note",
                      "fill": "#645A5A",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Preview above renders in Noto Sans SC @ 800 as a stand-in — Pencil cannot render PingFang SC (Apple-proprietary system font). Real Apple visitors see PingFang SC; other platforms fall through to Noto Sans SC, then Microsoft YaHei, then system.\n\nLive font-family stack (copied verbatim from computed CSS):\n  \"Special Gothic Expanded One\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Noto Sans SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", system-ui, -apple-system, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, Arial, sans-serif\n  font-weight: 800\n  font-synthesis: none\n\nDela Gothic One is deliberately EXCLUDED from this stack — it caused synthetic-bold glyph corruption on CJK characters. Do not add it back.",
                      "lineHeight": 1.4,
                      "fontFamily": "Mona Sans",
                      "fontSize": 11,
                      "fontWeight": "300"
                    }
                  ]
