              "type": "text",
              "id": "FQCwJ",
              "name": "Component Note",
              "fill": "#645A5A",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• Two-column layout on desktop, collapses to single column below the sm breakpoint.  • Department order is editorial — producer-side departments (Production → Camera → G&E) on the left, creative/finish (Art → Casting → Post) on the right.  • Role labels always UPPERCASE Mona Sans Regular, names sentence case Mona Sans Medium.  • Diacritics required — every Vietnamese name in the sample above should render intact.",
              "lineHeight": 1.5,
              "fontFamily": "Mona Sans",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
