                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "vN41Y",
                  "name": "Sub",
                  "fill": "#645A5A",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "For consolidated marketing/SEO copy at the bottom of pages (e.g. About's \"More About Vantage\"). Deliberately de-emphasized — no display-face headings, no card treatment, no split-emphasis. Reads as reference material, not competing with portfolio-forward content above it.",
