              "fill": "#645A5A",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "• 5 items only — Home / Work / About / Blog / Contact. Send a Brief no longer occupies its own nav slot; it lives as a CTA on the Contact page.  • Active state: bolded label + 2px yellow indicator underneath.  • Wordmark ends up in the top-left slot per the tokens doc's approved placement rules for content pages (top-left = preferred).  • Language toggle EN / 中 — mirrors current live behavior.  • Search icon flagged as TBD — component includes a visible TBD tag until Zach confirms functional status. Do not design a real search UI yet.  • Mobile: full-screen black takeover already shipped and live-tested — desktop treatment (this component) evolves separately per the still-open desktop-nav decision.",
